  "id": "phoria",
  "term": "phoria",
  "definition": "Phoria is a latent eye misalignment seen when the two eyes are no longer fused into single binocular vision. It describes the eyes’ relative position under that condition and is described by direction, such as outward, inward, or vertical deviation.",
